      propertyPath: text
      value: 'If you''ve come this far I suppose the right thing to do would be to
        assist you. The four larger tombs, at opposite ends of the rooms, are silent,
        their souls not properly laid to rest.


        If you give each one an
        offering, an acknowledgement of the cause of their death, they will allow
        you to proceed further in.'
