--- !u!114 &1764684234
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1764684231}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ca11473daf775064b8124960fb79b42e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueScene
  text: 
  characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  characterName: 
  fullscreenButton: {fileID: 914989183}
  dialogues:
  - speaker: Player
    text: "Those names\u2026"
  - speaker: Uncle
    text: "Well look who it is! It\u2019s been a minute? \u2026A year?"
  - speaker: Mother
    text: "You look familiar\u2026. No, you\u2019ve changed quite a bit haven\u2019t
      you\u2026"
  - speaker: Player
    text: I... it took so long...
  - speaker: Father
    text: "No need to look so glum. You\u2019re back anyhow\u2026 that should mean
      the war\u2019s over right?"
  - speaker: Father
    text: ...
  - speaker: Father
    text: "What happened here was going to happen. All the other towns were wiped
      long before ours was. None of this was preventable on our end\u2026you couldn\u2019t\u2019ve
      done anything."
  - speaker: Player
    text: What... what happened to you?
  - speaker: Father
    text: "We were alright for a while, a bit after you left. But a lot happened\u2026eventually
      we had to resort to thieving. I guess we couldn\u2019t avoid it, either\u2026you
      had the right idea\u2026"
  - speaker: Father
    text: "We were alright for a while, a bit after you left. But a lot happened\u2026eventually
      we had to resort to thieving. I guess we couldn\u2019t avoid it, either\u2026you
      had the right idea\u2026"
  - speaker: Father
    text: Are you heading out?
  - speaker: Player
    text: No, there are people I still need to see.
  - speaker: Father
    text: "Right\u2026be careful then. These issues don\u2019t end that easily, you
      know. You\u2019re better off getting far away from here."
  - speaker: Player
    text: Meaning?
  - speaker: Father
    text: "Even when things were calm, no one ever knew what was happening. No reports,
      no statements. You\u2019re better off leaving here- as long as the kingdom
      works the way it does, no one\u2019s safe. I believe what just ended wasn\u2019t
      really the end."
  - speaker: Father
    text: I beg you, please leave.
  - speaker: Player
    text: You don't say a word, but your face makes your intention clear.
  - speaker: Father
    text: "Of course you wouldn\u2019t leave, but whatever you\u2019re planning isn\u2019t
      going to be easy you know. If you want to stay, whatever\u2019s happening in
      the kingdom needs to end\u2026whatever that may be."
  - speaker: Player
    text: The kingdom isn't my concern anymore, only my family.
  - speaker: Father
    text: You know its never that simple. You're in denial if you think what's happening
      around you won't continue to affect you.
  - speaker: Father
    text: Still... Stay safe out there, kid.
  currentDialogue: 0
